    - "@type": FAQPage
      mainEntity[5]{"@type",name,acceptedAnswer{"@type",text}}:
        Question,Who is Bayram Dökmeci and what does he offer?,Answer,"Bayram Dökmeci is a freelance full-stack developer. He develops web applications using PHP, MySQL and JavaScript, manages Linux servers and deployments, and sets up self-hosted solutions. He works remotely from Türkiye for businesses and agencies in Germany, Austria and Switzerland."
        Question,Does a developer based in Türkiye work in German?,Answer,"Yes. Briefings, discussions and documentation are in German. You speak directly to the person writing the code, without an interpreter or an intermediary project manager."
        Question,Which technologies do you use?,Answer,"PHP and MySQL for the backend; JavaScript (ES6+), HTML and CSS for the frontend; REST APIs, Git and CI/CD; and Linux servers with Nginx and Docker."
        Question,Can you take over existing projects?,Answer,"Yes. I take over existing web projects, analyse the code and server environment, and develop them further or improve their stability."
        Question,How does working together work?,Answer,"After a free initial consultation, we clarify the objectives, scope and schedule. I then work in short iterations with regular feedback. We communicate via WhatsApp, email or video call."
